    "methods_description": "Participants performed 72 trials per block. Each trial showed a fixation dot until the response, followed by a 50 ms feedback circle. Responses were made with the f and j keys. Feedback compared each inter-response interval to an adaptive window around the target duration. Event triggers encode condition (tempo, pattern, starting hand) and response type. Participant 12 has bad triggers.",
